OL,3,GNEWSATown's 'ambitious' future becomes 
OL,4,Aa video game                           
OL,6,FA town centre has been turned into a   
OL,7,Fvideo game to allow residents to       
OL,8,Fexplore how the area could look after  
OL,9,Fits redevelopment.                     
OL,11,FA virtual reality version of Gateshead 
OL,12,Fhas been created by VR planning firm   
OL,13,FDigital Urban, which will allow users  
OL,14,Fto "walk" or "run" through the town.   
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
