OL,3,GNEWSATown's 'ambitious' future becomes 
OL,4,Aa video game                           
OL,6,FGateshead Council said the game, which 
OL,7,Fcan be played in the foyer of Tesco at 
OL,8,FTrinity Square on Thursday and         
OL,9,FSaturday, would allow residents to     
OL,10,Flearn more about redevelopment plans   
OL,11,Fand share their ideas in-game for what 
OL,12,Fthey would like to see built in the    
OL,13,Freal world.                            
OL,15,FReform UK council leader Nick Allan    
OL,16,Fsaid there were "ambitious plans for   
OL,17,Fthe future" but it was "vital that     
OL,18,Flocal people help shape them."         
